Subject: [PATCH] EDEN_UP_VDEC_BUSY + EDEN_UP_MOVIE_CLOCK: Lichii #659/#809: vdec refuses input packets with busy from 24 queued, holds the refused one; movie clock does not jump ahead (with EDEN_UP_MOVIE_PACE); off by default

--- a/src/core/hle/service/nx2_gsv.h
+++ b/src/core/hle/service/nx2_gsv.h
@@ -2832,6 +2832,9 @@
 
